# ES cluster URLs to scan directly (one per line, # = comment).
#
# Derive from GET _remote/info on the overview cluster:
#   1. Find relevant clusters (e.g. monitor-*)
#   2. Take the proxy_address hostname, drop :9400, prefix https://
#
# Example entry from _remote/info:
#   "monitor-aws-eu-west-1": {
#     "proxy_address": "8435137e1d624a1d9810728b8b382001.eu-west-1.aws.qa.cld.elstc.co:9400"
#   }
# Becomes:
#   https://8435137e1d624a1d9810728b8b382001.eu-west-1.aws.qa.cld.elstc.co
#
# Add an API key for each cluster:
#   ./otm <env> add-key <url> <encoded-api-key>
